  "description": [
    {
      "ja": "「30 MINUTES SISTERS」シリーズに新たなシスター「30MS SIS-V00 ライディラ[カラーA]」が登場！",
      "en": "A new sister \"30MS SIS-V00 Raidilla [Color A]\" is now available in the \" 30 MINUTES SISTERS\" series!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 組み立て易さ、作業導線を意識し、「最適」を追求したランナーのパーツ配置により、スムーズな組み立てが可能。",
      "en": "• Smooth assembly is possible due to the ``optimum'' Runner parts arrangement, with consideration for ease of assembly and work flow."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• ボードパーツが付属。足裏のジョイントを接続することにより搭乗可能。",
      "en": "• Board parts included. Boarding is possible by connecting the joints on the soles of the feet."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• ヘルメットのバイザーはパーツの差し替えで開閉を再現。",
      "en": "• Helmet visor can be opened and closed by replacing parts."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• [カラーA]のフェイスパーツにはタンポ印刷を採用。「通常」「怒り」「笑顔」の3種類の豊かな表情が付属。口の中の色分けはパーツ分割で再現。",
      "en": "• [Color A] face parts use tampo printing. Comes with 3 types of rich expressions: \"normal \", \" angry \", and \" smiling\". The color coding inside the mouth is reproduced by dividing the parts."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 腹部には股関節パーツの抜け止め機構を設けることにより、可動時のパーツ分離を配慮。",
      "en": "• By providing a mechanism to prevent the hip joint parts from falling out on the abdomen, consideration has been given to separating the parts during movement."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• ジャケットはパーツの差し替えで着脱が可能。",
      "en": "• The jacket can be attached and detached by replacing parts."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 腕、脚に装着可能なリングタイプのジョイントパーツも多数付属。",
      "en": "• Many ring-type joint parts that can be attached to arms and legs are also included."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 「30 MINUTES SISTERS」はフェイスパーツ/ヘアスタイルパーツ/ボディパーツを部位ごとにラインアップ展開。別売りのパーツと組み替えて自分好みのシスターを創ることができる。",
      "en": "• \"30 MINUTES SISTERS\" offers a lineup of face parts, hairstyle parts, and body parts by body part. You can create your own sister by combining parts sold separately."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 30 MINUTES LABEL共通の3mmジョイントを採用。他シリーズのパーツもオプションとして装着が可能。",
      "en": "• Adopts 3mm joint common to 30 MINUTES LABEL. Parts from other series can also be installed as options."
    }
  ],
